    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, yeah, rest helps for a bit but it doesn't change the fact that in a billion years none of this matters. not my work, not my life, not even the earth. if everything is just temporary and random, then the struggle to keep going feels kind of... fake? like, why put effort into a movie that's just going to be deleted anyway?\n on the idea there is no reason to endure the weight of it",
